"description":"One smart move can open the entire board. Can you spot it?\n\nArrow Maze is a polished path puzzle built around simple rules and meaningful choices. Every arrow needs a clear route before it can leave. Study the grid, free the right pieces in the right order, and watch a crowded maze fall into place. A rushed tap may cost a life; a well-planned chain turns into a satisfying combo.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n• Read the direction of every arrow.\n• Tap a piece only when the path ahead is open.\n• Clear key arrows first to create new routes.\n• Finish the board, protect your lives, and earn up to three stars.\n\nKEEP EXPLORING\n• Take on 240 levels spread across seven distinct worlds.\n• Play a new Daily Puzzle, grow your streak, and complete three Daily Quests.\n• Relax with gentler Zen sessions.\n• With Premium, transform a selected photo into a custom playable maze.\n• Earn achievements and compare your progress through Game Center.\n• Personalize the experience with colourful visual themes.\n\nArrow Maze is easy to pick up and increasingly challenging to master. It fits a quick break, a daily routine, or an evening of focused problem-solving.\n\nOptional weekly and annual Premium subscriptions are available. The current price, duration, and included benefits appear before purchase. Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled in your Apple Account settings at least 24 hours before the current period ends.\n\nTerms of Use: https://kinapp.dev/arrowmaze/terms/", "trackCensoredName":"Arrow Maze: Logic Puzzle", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/ca/app/arrow-maze-logic-puzzle/id6800708435?uo=4", "averageUserRating":0, "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "sellerName":"Stepanov Dmitry", "userRatingCount":0}]
